    (genuinely moderate n for every 2D form; the constant w sets how moderate)
==============================================================================
  -3 triangular h=1   : layer-12 radius^2=   7  ->  first U>3N at N=  43 (U=132, U/N=3.07)
  -4 square h=1       : layer-12 radius^2=  25  ->  first U>3N at N= 121 (U=368, U/N=3.04)
